<!-- components/ad-banner/ad-banner.wxml -->
<!-- 通用广告横幅：items 为空时整块不渲染 -->
<view class="ad-banner" wx:if="{{items.length}}">
  <view
    class="ad-banner-item"
    wx:for="{{items}}"
    wx:key="_id"
    data-item="{{item}}"
    bindtap="onTap"
  >
    <!-- 优先图片横幅；无图回退渐变文字卡 -->
    <image wx:if="{{item.image}}" class="ad-banner-img" src="{{item.image}}" mode="widthFix" />
    <view
      wx:else
      class="ad-banner-card"
      style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, {{item.bgFrom || '#FFF1E8'}} 0%, {{item.bgTo || '#FFE0C2'}} 100%);"
    >
      <view wx:if="{{item.emoji}}" class="ad-banner-emoji">{{item.emoji}}</view>
      <view class="ad-banner-info">
        <view wx:if="{{item.title}}" class="ad-banner-title">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view wx:if="{{item.sub}}" class="ad-banner-sub">{{item.sub}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
